{"item": "ds03", "show": "dbza", "youtube": "OGm-3LQEs4k", "title": "Yamcha Strikes Out", "duration": 231, "lines": [{"i": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "Running"}, {"i": 1, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "Squatting"}, {"i": 2, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "Push-ups"}, {"i": 3, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "Sit-ups..."}, {"i": 4, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "Forget"}, {"i": 5, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.27, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "Forget ALL of that!"}, {"i": 6, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.47, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lanipator", "text": "Why have I been working out like a sucker"}, {"i": 7, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lanipator", "text": "Why have I been working out like a sucker all this time..."}, {"i": 8, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lanipator", "text": "When the power of Saitama is right in my pocket,"}, {"i": 9, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.53, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lanipator", "text": "thanks to our sponsor -"}, {"i": 10, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.87, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "Road to Hero!"}, {"i": 11, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.87, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "You have over 50 heroes to play as and collect, including:"}, {"i": 12, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "Genos,"}, {"i": 13, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "my boy, Metal Bat,"}, {"i": 14, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "Tatsumaki,"}, {"i": 15, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.33, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "Speed-o'-Sound Sonic"}, {"i": 16, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "Is he a hero?"}, {"i": 17, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "And it's the only One Punch Plan™️ for any One Punch Stan™️ on the go,"}, {"i": 18, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "'cause you can play it literally anywhere!"}, {"i": 19, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.73, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "You can play it while you're working out;"}, {"i": 20, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "cooking;"}, {"i": 21, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.07, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "making a sundae;"}, {"i": 22, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.07, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "eating a sundae;"}, {"i": 23, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.67, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "crackin' open a cold one;"}, {"i": 24, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.47, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "praying to an Old One;"}, {"i": 25, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.53, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "petting. Mr. Steak; and"}, {"i": 26, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "pooping!"}, {"i": 27, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "...mostly..."}, {"i": 28, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "mo-mostly pooping."}, {"i": 29, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "Y- you g--"}, {"i": 30, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.27, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "Y- you g-- you pl--"}, {"i": 31, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "you play it a lot while you're pooping."}, {"i": 32, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "And you can play One Punch Man: Road to Hero 2.0"}, {"i": 33, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "And you can play One Punch Man: Road to Hero 2.0 *right now*"}, {"i": 34, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "⬇️ by clicking the links in the description ⬇️"}, {"i": 35, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.93, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "⬇️ or in the pinned comment below ⬇️"}, {"i": 36, "start": 0.0, "end": 5.13, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "and use the provided code to get 10 free recruit tokens for one Multi Summon."}, {"i": 37, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.33, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "So thank you again to One Punch Man: Road to Hero,"}, {"i": 38, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "and now here's"}, {"i": 39, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "One Punch Man", "text": "and now here's a video about Yamcha."}, {"i": 40, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.47, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Captions by Umbire the Phantom"}, {"i": 41, "start": 1.47, "end": 4.29, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Dragon Ball Z Abridged - Dragon ShortZ Episode 4: Yamcha Strikes Out"}, {"i": 42, "start": 4.53, "end": 7.15, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Please keep these captions clean for those who need them. Thank you!"}, {"i": 43, "start": 7.85, "end": 17.17, "kind": "sfx", "speaker": null, "text": "somewhat intense music"}, {"i": 44, "start": 17.35, "end": 19.41, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Yamcha smashes one out of the park"}, {"i": 45, "start": 19.41, "end": 19.91, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Yamcha smashes one out of the park... literally"}, {"i": 46, "start": 19.91, "end": 20.81, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "window breaks] [Yamcha smashes one out of the park... literally"}, {"i": 47, "start": 20.81, "end": 21.39, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Baby Trunks", "text": "[crying]"}, {"i": 48, "start": 21.39, "end": 22.23, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Baby Trunks", "text": "[crying] VEGETA: *MOTHER*"}, {"i": 49, "start": 22.23, "end": 22.73, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Baby Trunks", "text": "[crying] VEGETA: *MOTHERFU--*"}, {"i": 50, "start": 22.85, "end": 24.83, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Announcer", "text": "And there you have it, folks!"}, {"i": 51, "start": 24.83, "end": 28.29, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Announcer", "text": "Another home run from the Baseball Bandit Yamcha,"}, {"i": 52, "start": 28.29, "end": 31.87, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Announcer", "text": "marking his 500th consecutive home run!"}, {"i": 53, "start": 31.87, "end": 34.01, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Announcer", "text": "Aaannnnnnnd the crowd goes---"}, {"i": 54, "start": 34.41, "end": 36.01, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Krillin", "text": "WOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!"}, {"i": 55, "start": 36.13, "end": 37.47, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Announcer", "text": "[sighs]"}, {"i": 56, "start": 37.47, "end": 40.37, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Announcer", "text": "--...out of the stadium..."}, {"i": 57, "start": 41.47, "end": 42.19, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Whew!"}, {"i": 58, "start": 42.19, "end": 43.21, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Hell yeah, guys!"}, {"i": 59, "start": 43.21, "end": 44.91, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Another trophy for the case!"}, {"i": 60, "start": 44.91, "end": 46.51, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Gonzalez, you see me out there?"}, {"i": 61, "start": 47.17, "end": 48.91, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gonzales", "text": "[deep sigh]"}, {"i": 62, "start": 48.91, "end": 49.67, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gonzales", "text": "...Yeah."}, {"i": 63, "start": 49.67, "end": 50.61, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gonzales", "text": "...Yeah. Yeah, I did."}, {"i": 64, "start": 50.61, "end": 53.43, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Bet those legs are tired from running home so much, huh Dave?"}, {"i": 65, "start": 53.43, "end": 54.87, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Dave", "text": "I'm tired all right..."}, {"i": 66, "start": 54.87, "end": 56.91, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Didn't even break a sweat out there."}, {"i": 67, "start": 56.91, "end": 59.97, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Might just skip the showers and go straight to the bar!"}, {"i": 68, "start": 60.23, "end": 63.57, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Teammate", "text": "Yo, Yamcha, coach wants to talk with you on the way out. Owner's with him."}, {"i": 69, "start": 63.57, "end": 64.77, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "The owner?"}, {"i": 70, "start": 64.77, "end": 67.51, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Oh man, maybe they want to renegotiate my contract!"}, {"i": 71, "start": 67.51, "end": 70.03, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Or maybe I'm being inducted into the baseball Hall of Fame!"}, {"i": 72, "start": 70.03, "end": 71.07, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Or maybe I'm"}, {"i": 73, "start": 71.07, "end": 71.63, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Or maybe I'm-- COACH: --fired."}, {"i": 74, "start": 72.35, "end": 74.41, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "...Do you mean... I'm ON fire?"}, {"i": 75, "start": 74.41, "end": 75.11, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "No."}, {"i": 76, "start": 75.39, "end": 79.19, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "He means, for the first time in your career, you're *out*, Bandit."}, {"i": 77, "start": 79.19, "end": 80.27, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Wha-- No!!!"}, {"i": 78, "start": 80.27, "end": 81.65, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "You can't be serious!"}, {"i": 79, "start": 81.65, "end": 83.81, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Coach, we haven't lost a game since I *joined!*"}, {"i": 80, "start": 83.81, "end": 85.39, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "And that's the problem, kid."}, {"i": 81, "start": 85.39, "end": 86.83, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "You've ruined the game."}, {"i": 82, "start": 86.83, "end": 88.95, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "You've taken the sport outta the sport."}, {"i": 83, "start": 88.95, "end": 92.11, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "Nobody wants to watch Mr. Satan enter a kid's karate championship!"}, {"i": 84, "start": 92.61, "end": 93.31, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "I'd watch that."}, {"i": 85, "start": 93.31, "end": 95.81, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "Yeah, but only a psychopath would watch that more than once."}, {"i": 86, "start": 95.81, "end": 96.47, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "Um..."}, {"i": 87, "start": 96.47, "end": 96.97, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "Right?"}, {"i": 88, "start": 96.97, "end": 99.27, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "Point is, nobody's buying tickets."}, {"i": 89, "start": 99.57, "end": 104.23, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "Those bleachers would be emptier than Nicky Town if it weren't for those mooks you gave season passes to."}, {"i": 90, "start": 104.23, "end": 105.11, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Roshi", "text": "[snoring]"}, {"i": 91, "start": 105.11, "end": 107.15, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Roshi", "text": "[jolting awake, incoherent]"}, {"i": 92, "start": 108.51, "end": 110.27, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Roshi", "text": "...Where's my beer?"}, {"i": 93, "start": 110.27, "end": 111.53, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "You can't do this!"}, {"i": 94, "start": 111.53, "end": 113.01, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "This game, baseball..."}, {"i": 95, "start": 113.01, "end": 114.75, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "it's all I've got left."}, {"i": 96, "start": 114.75, "end": 117.31, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "My ex-girlfriend shacked up with an alien prince,"}, {"i": 97, "start": 117.31, "end": 119.23, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "most of my friends are married or busy"}, {"i": 98, "start": 119.23, "end": 121.73, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "or have three eyes and are *total assholes*--"}, {"i": 99, "start": 122.19, "end": 123.71, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "...without baseball..."}, {"i": 100, "start": 123.71, "end": 125.31, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "...I'll have nothing."}, {"i": 101, "start": 125.31, "end": 126.67, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "Yeah, nothin'."}, {"i": 102, "start": 126.67, "end": 127.95, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "...and 20 billion zeni."}, {"i": 103, "start": 128.17, "end": 129.09, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "What will I---"}, {"i": 104, "start": 129.51, "end": 130.15, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "...huh?"}, {"i": 105, "start": 130.15, "end": 130.81, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "20."}, {"i": 106, "start": 130.81, "end": 131.57, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "20. Billion."}, {"i": 107, "start": 131.57, "end": 132.37, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "20. Billion. Zeni."}, {"i": 108, "start": 132.91, "end": 137.09, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "League rules says I can't leave you high and dry, and I also can't bar you from"}, {"i": 109, "start": 137.09, "end": 140.55, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "accepting sponsorship deals or promotional tie-ins..."}, {"i": 110, "start": 141.01, "end": 141.75, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "So..."}, {"i": 111, "start": 141.75, "end": 143.63, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "So... you sign this non-compete,"}, {"i": 112, "start": 143.63, "end": 146.07, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "and you'll be set for the rest of your life."}, {"i": 113, "start": 146.07, "end": 148.39, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "RADIO [Yamcha singing]: Cat loves food, y-yeah-yeah-yeah!!"}, {"i": 114, "start": 148.39, "end": 150.83, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "Cat loves food, y-yeeeeeeaaahhh!"}, {"i": 115, "start": 150.83, "end": 152.27, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "Cat loves food, y-yeah-y---"}, {"i": 116, "start": 152.27, "end": 153.15, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "[turns radio off]"}, {"i": 117, "start": 153.15, "end": 153.93, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Owner", "text": "...Sorry."}, {"i": 118, "start": 153.93, "end": 156.53, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yamcha", "text": "So-- ...so this is a win?"}, {"i": 119, "start": 156.53, "end": 159.47, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Coach", "text": "Kid... you do nothin' *but* win."}, {"i": 120, "start": 160.59, "end": 162.99, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "And so, Yamcha gave his signature"}, {"i": 121, "start": 162.99, "end": 164.61, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "and retired from his ambitious"}, {"i": 122, "start": 164.61, "end": 166.27, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "and retired from his ambitious (and boring) sports career."}, {"i": 123, "start": 166.67, "end": 171.63, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "He then invested in, and subsequently purchased, the HETAP beverage corporation,"}, {"i": 124, "start": 171.63, "end": 173.31, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "doubling his net worth."}, {"i": 125, "start": 173.71, "end": 178.13, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "He now owns several sports bars under the franchise Wolf Fang Grill,"}, {"i": 126, "start": 178.13, "end": 180.85, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "where he lets all his friends eat for free."}, {"i": 127, "start": 180.85, "end": 182.31, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I'm back, bitches!"}, {"i": 128, "start": 182.31, "end": 183.33, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "Also Vegeta."}, {"i": 129, "start": 184.19, "end": 188.97, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "Coming up next, an hour retrospective on martial arts champion, Jackie Chun."}, {"i": 130, "start": 188.97, "end": 192.05, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "Where did he come from? And after all these years..."}, {"i": 131, "start": 192.05, "end": 195.85, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Narrator", "text": "where has this mysterious and illustrious fighter gone?"}, {"i": 132, "start": 196.25, "end": 197.79, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Roshi", "text": "...I think my ride left."}, {"i": 133, "start": 198.35, "end": 198.99, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "sniffs"}, {"i": 134, "start": 200.01, "end": 202.01, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Roshi", "text": "...BABY GAMERA!!!"}, {"i": 135, "start": 202.37, "end": 204.83, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Baby Gamera flies in"}, {"i": 136, "start": 205.71, "end": 206.97, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Roshi", "text": "Titty bar!"}, {"i": 137, "start": 206.97, "end": 207.83, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Baby Gamera takes off"}, {"i": 138, "start": 207.83, "end": 211.45, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "soft piano outro plays"}, {"i": 139, "start": 211.45, "end": 216.35, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Thanks for watching! Don't hesitate to ask if I can make any improvements, and be sure to give TFS some love!"}, {"i": 140, "start": 230.51, "end": 231.01, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Roshi", "text": "subscribe to pewdiepie"}], "segments": []}